ging done with a smaller weapon.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>The <a href=\"/page/Item:Pirate_Treasure_Map\" title=\"Item:Pirate Treasure Map\">Pirate Treasure Map</a>, the 3 items from the <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Corsair&#39;s_Cunning\" title=\"Named item sets\">Corsair's Cunning</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Corsair&#39;s_Cunning\" title=\"Named item sets\">Corsair's Cunning</a>:</b> <br />2 Item Set Bonus: <a href=\"/page/Underwater_Action\" title=\"Underwater Action\">Underwater Action</a><br />3 Item Set Bonus: <a href=\"/page/Feather_Falling\" title=\"Feather Falling\">Feather Falling</a></span></span> set, the 4 'Scoundrel's type' weapons and <a href=\"/page/Item:Brine_Shaman%27s_Staff\" title=\"Item:Brine Shaman&#39;s Staff\">Brine Shaman's Staff</a> have a chance of appearing in the end reward list of any of the <a href=\"/page/Three-Barrel_Cove_(heroic)\" title=\"Three-Barrel Cove (heroic)\">Three-Barrel Cove (heroic)</a> quests, except <a href=\"/page/Guard_Duty\" title=\"Guard Duty\">Guard Duty</a>. Every third completion you will receive a complete list.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817225239\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.092 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.160 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3616/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29299/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9138/2097152 bytes\nHighest expa